    LLM: 'Each hand has three phases: auction (players bid; high bidder declares trump), melding (all players show melds; points counted), and trick play (high bidder leads; follow suit; trump wins if unable to follow). Trick points plus meld must meet or exceed the bid or the team is set (bid subtracted).',
